// 03 - Unhandled errors, grouped.
//
// After clicking the "Break me" button (page/break-me-button.tsx) twice, the
// "Telemetry smoke test" message should appear in outerMessage with two occurrences.
//
// `users` turns a crash list into a priority list: one user hitting something forty
// times is a different conversation from forty users hitting it once.
// Wire this query to an Azure Monitor alert rule for crash notification.
exceptions
| where timestamp > ago(7d)
| where cloud_RoleInstance == "CDS Data Export"
| summarize occurrences = count(), users = dcount(user_Id), lastSeen = max(timestamp) by problemId, outerMessage
| order by occurrences desc
